{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は今年最後のーーーーーーーー\nふぁみたん全員で叫んでくださいね？\n叫ぶんですよ？笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ....一応場所はわきまえて\n家で一人の方は御近所さんを気にしながら、\n電車の中の方は小さく心の中で、\n大草原にいる方は大きな声で⁽⁽ଘ( ˊᵕˋ )ଓ⁾⁾笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、いきますよ？\n今日は11月の何日何曜日ですか？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日の金曜日♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って答えられ方は大正解◎\n何か何か違うものを叫んでしまった方は\n反省してください(´;ω;`)む"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではブログの13金企画に\n移りたいと思います\n残念ながら日付がまわってしまった方の\nコメントはお返事出来ません(´;ω;`)\nごめんなさい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではＮｏ．13からの方から\n順にお返事載せて行きたいと思います◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/11/13/0361691/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の企画も凄く盛り上がって\n本当にたくさんの方にコメント\nして頂きました♡うれち〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中には凄い短文のコメントや\n長文のコメントまで⁽⁽ଘ( ˊᵕˋ )ଓ⁾⁾\n見ていて本当に面白かったです\nきっと短文の方は下二桁狙いだったかな？笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また来年の5月に行いますので\nその時もぜひ皆さん参加してみてね？\nんーだいぶ先だけど....笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは皆さん楽しい13日の金曜日を\nお過ごしください〜\n私はこれから打ち合わせしてきます♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、それと日付が変わるギリギリで\n13日の金曜日聞くんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}